      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, The functions of the Office of Civil Defense were transferred to the Police Department by Executive Order No. 38, dated August 29, 1975, and the Police Commissioner was appointed interim coordinator of the functions of Emergency Services—Civil Preparedness by that Order; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.2155,
          "min": -1.1409
        },
        "category": {
