      "text": "§ 2. The Police Commissioner, as the Director of Civil Preparedness, shall be responsible to the Mayor and shall serve as the local Director of Civil Defense, with the powers of a local Director of Civil Defense under the Laws of 1951, Chapter 784, as amended.",
